<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>主命數 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E4%B8%BB%E5%91%BD%E6%95%B8/</link><description>Recent content in 主命數 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/tags/%E4%B8%BB%E5%91%BD%E6%95%B8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>主命數與生日數有什麼不同？先核對算法</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%BB%E5%91%BD%E6%95%B8%E8%88%87%E7%94%9F%E6%97%A5%E6%95%B8%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%85%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%B0%8D%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/</link><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E4%B8%BB%E5%91%BD%E6%95%B8%E8%88%87%E7%94%9F%E6%97%A5%E6%95%B8%E6%9C%89%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%8C%E5%85%88%E6%A0%B8%E5%B0%8D%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;有人說你是「主命數 7」，另一張表又寫「生日數 16／7」，哪個才對？先看它們從生日的哪一部分取數。這是生命靈數流派使用的象徵分類，算法一致比解釋得神秘更重要。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>生命靈數怎麼算？用一個生日逐步核對</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E9%9D%88%E6%95%B8%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%AE%97%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%80%8B%E7%94%9F%E6%97%A5%E9%80%90%E6%AD%A5%E6%A0%B8%E5%B0%8D/</link><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E9%9D%88%E6%95%B8%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%AE%97%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E5%80%8B%E7%94%9F%E6%97%A5%E9%80%90%E6%AD%A5%E6%A0%B8%E5%B0%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;想算生命靈數，卻發現兩個網站給你不同答案？先別急著選一個相信。把生日寫成西元年月日、拆成單一數字，核對每一步，通常就能找出差異。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>